downloaded directly through the Quest browser or transferred via USB connection \n\n\u2022 Supports up to 7 panoramic images.\n\n\u2022 Filename-based image sorting \u2014 rename your images to create your preferred viewing sequence. Recommended format: 01_Filename, 02_Filename, 03_Filename.\n\n\u2022 Controller-free navigation using hand tracking\n A. Turn VR mode on and off using press-and-hold buttons\n B. Navigate to previous and next scenes using left and right hand-interactable buttons\n", "short_description": "A simple panoramic image viewer that accesses the local Download folder (Quest 3 > Internal shared storage > Download) and loads compatible images. Users can turn VR mode on and off and move to the next or previous scene using hand-interactable buttons, completely controller-free."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1dnDtgne-BjqunxM_eIRLX1_YxkPAcCDCv-1N-6mCooM/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Futureproof XR Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.yongwoopark.com/minisphere", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1336734776188347"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1399527891534877"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1399527891534877"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"n